            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>Online activation of Lina Pro: the key is activated on each of your Macs (three per user), and "Remove the license from this Mac" frees its place.</li>
<li>The 14-day trial is recorded once per Mac.</li>
<li>Only an anonymous fingerprint of the Mac is sent, never your calls, contacts or history.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
